   "widgets_values": [
    "Redraw the character from the image as a small overworld walking sprite of a Pokemon HeartGold game: full body, about three heads tall, standing, facing the viewer (front view), feet together. Keep exactly the same face, hair, clothes, colors and accessories as the character in the image. Style of the Pokemon HeartGold and SoulSilver sprites: clean dark 1-pixel outline, flat cel shading with two or three tones per color, limited palette, crisp square pixels, no anti-aliasing, no blur, no gradient. Single character, centered, plain solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no shadow on the ground, no text, no frame."
   ],
   "title": "Sprite de terrain : de face : consigne",
